# Ojisan in Another World — Deep Engine & Requirements Analysis

## Executive Summary

The [requirements.md](file:///e:/Anitigravity%20Projects/Ojisan-in-another-world/requirements.md) defines **20 engines** and 7 sections of core architecture. The [Project/](file:///e:/Anitigravity%20Projects/Ojisan-in-another-world/Project) directory contains **14 TypeScript files** that implement a deep **NPC Procedural Generation + Intimacy Encounter** system. This is the **NPC Population & Simulation Engine (§5.9)**, the **Procedural Content Generation Engine (§5.20)**, and significant portions of the **Intimacy Engine (§5.2)** and **Pregnancy Engine (§5.15)**.

**Of the 20 engines described in the requirements, only ~3–4 have any actual code. The remaining 16–17 engines exist only as 2–5 line specifications.** Below is a detailed per-engine audit.

